rg/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M10.1111 13L3 21M19 3L13.0897 9.64914M3 3L16 21H21L8 3H3Z\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n</svg>\n</i>\n\n                X            </a>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"event-details__description\">\n                        <p class=\"paragraph\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;\">Join us at&nbsp;Canada Square Park&nbsp;for our summer&nbsp;Film Club&nbsp;running throughout June, July, and August.</span></p>\n<p class=\"paragraph\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;\">This season’s lineup of films features everything from recent releases and award winners to cult classics. Our packed program has something for everyone to enjoy.</span></p>\n<p class=\"paragraph\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;\">If you’re in the mood for a rom-com, a sing-along, Bollywood, or Hollywood, you’ll find it all here at our Tuesday and Sunday evening screenings.</span></p>\n<p class=\"paragraph\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;\">Our popular family films will also be back on Saturday mornings, offering the perfect start to a weekend with the kids.</span></p>\n<p class=\"paragraph\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;\">Our films are free to attend, just bring a picnic blanket and your favourite refreshments.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n                    </div>\n\n                <div class=\"event-details__accordion\">\n            <div class=\"new-accordion\">\n        <div class=\"new-accordion__item\">\n        <button aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"new-accordion__button\" aria-controls=\"accordion-content-june-listings\">\n            <h2 class=\"new-accordion__title\">JUNE LISTINGS</h2>\n\n            <i class=\"new-accordion__icon new-accordion__icon--plus icon icon--add-new-plus icon--icon-loaded\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M12 4V20M4 12H20\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n</svg>\n</i>\n            <i class=\"new-accordion__icon new-accordion__icon--minus icon icon--dash icon--icon-loaded\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M3 12H21\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n</svg>\n</i>\n\n        </button>\n        <div class=\"new-accordion__content\" id=\"accordion-content-june-listings\">\n            <p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"width: 97.2209%; height: 253px;\" width=\"487\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 23px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 66.2612%; height: 23px;\"><strong> Wicked: For Good (PG)</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 3.40849%; height: 23px;\"><strong>Tue</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 5.38405%; text-align: center; height: 23px;\"><strong>9</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 14.8427%; height: 23px;\"><strong>June</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 47.8595%; height: 23px;\"><strong>7pm</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 23px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 66.2612%; height: 23px;\">\n<p>The epic conclusion to the untold story of the witches of Oz, as Elphaba and Glinda face the consequences of their choices.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 3.40849%; height: 23px;\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width: 5.38405%; text-align: center; height: 23px;\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width: 14.8427%; height: 23px;\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width: 47.8595%; height: 23px;\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 23px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 66.2612%; height: 23px;\"><strong>Zootropolis 2 (PG)</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 3.40849%; height: 23px;\"><strong>Sat</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 5.38405%; text-align: center; height: 23px;\"><strong>13</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 14.8427%; height: 23px;\"><strong>June</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 47.8595%; height: 23px;\"><strong>10.30am</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 15.0pt;\">\n<td class=\"xl65\" style=\"width: 66.2612%; height: 15pt;\" width=\"792\" height=\"20\">\n<p>Judy Hopps and Nick Wilde return for another fast-paced mystery adventure in the vibrant animal metropolis.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 3.40849%; height: 23px;\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width: 5.38405%; text-align: center; height: 23px;\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width: 14.8427%; height: 23px;\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width: 47.8595%; height: 23px;\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 66.2612%;\"><strong>Swim Sistas</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 3.40849%; height: 23px;\"><strong>Tue</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 5.38405%; text-align: center; height: 23px;\"><strong>16</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 14.8427%; height: 23px;\"><strong>June</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 47.8595%; height: 23px;\"><strong>6.30pm</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 66.2612%;\">\n<p>Created by Northampton filmmaker Cat White, Swim Sistas looks at the sisterhood and resilience of black women across generations and their connection to swimming.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 3.40849%;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 5.38405%; text-align: center;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 14.8427%;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 47.8595%;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 23px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 66.2612%; height: 23px;\"><strong>The Shape of Water (15)</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 3.40849%; height: 23px;\"><strong>Tue</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 5.38405%; text-align: center; height: 23px;\"><strong>16</strong></td>\n<td sty