\n<td style=\"width: 47.8595%; height: 23px;\"><strong>7pm</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 15.0pt;\">\n<td class=\"xl65\" style=\"width: 66.2612%; height: 15pt;\" width=\"792\" height=\"20\">\n<p>A bold and satirical comedy about identity, as a teenager questions expectations at a conversion camp.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 3.40849%;\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width: 5.38405%; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width: 14.8427%;\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width: 47.8595%;\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 23px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 66.2612%; height: 23px;\"><strong>Matilda the Musical (PG)</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 3.40849%; height: 23px;\"><strong>Sat</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 5.38405%; text-align: center; height: 23px;\"><strong>27</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 14.8427%; height: 23px;\"><strong>June</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 47.8595%; height: 23px;\"><strong>10.30am</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 15.0pt;\">\n<td class=\"xl65\" style=\"width: 66.2612%; height: 15pt;\" width=\"792\" height=\"20\">\n<p>A vibrant musical adventure following a brilliant girl who uses courage, wit, and a little magic to change her story.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 3.40849%;\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width: 5.38405%; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width: 14.8427%;\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width: 47.8595%;\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 23px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 66.2612%; height: 23px;\"><strong>Love, Simon (12)</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 3.40849%; height: 23px;\"><strong>Sun</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 5.38405%; text-align: center; height: 23px;\"><strong>28</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 14.8427%; height: 23px;\"><strong>June</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 47.8595%; height: 23px;\"><strong>5pm</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 15.0pt;\">\n<td class=\"xl65\" style=\"width: 66.2612%; height: 15pt;\" width=\"792\" height=\"2