n                                    <div class=\"event-details__free-text-item\">\n                <h2 class=\"event-details__free-text-title\">\n                                    </h2>\n                <div class=\"event-details__free-text-content\">\n                    <p class=\"ai-optimize-6\"><strong>Your Feedback</strong></p>\n<p class=\"ai-optimize-7\">We value your feedback and ask that you complete our survey to be entered into a draw to for the chance to win a £250 Gift Card from one of Canary Wharf’s selected stores.</p>\n<p class=\"ai-optimize-8\"><a href=\"https://canarywharf.com/event-feedback/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" role=\"link\">Click here to complete our survey</a></p>\n<p class=\"ai-optimize-9\"><strong></strong></p><div class=\"su-spoiler su-spoiler-style-simple-last su-spoiler-icon-plus su-spoiler-closed\" data-scroll-offset=\"0\" data-anchor-in-url=\"no\"><div class=\"su-spoiler-title\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\"><strong><span class=\"su-spoiler-icon\"></span>Additional Event Information</strong></div><div class=\"su-spoiler-content su-u-clearfix su-u-trim\"><p></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"ai-optimize-10\"><strong>Filming &amp; Photography</strong></p>\n<p class=\"ai-optimize-11\">Filming and photography take place at most Canary Wharf events. Our film and photography staff will wear vests to clearly identify themselves. If you have any concerns about being photographed or filmed, please speak to staff onsite.</p>\n<p class=\"ai-optimize-12\"><a href=\"https://canarywharf-group.com/data-protection-privacy/\" role=\"link\">Data Protection &amp; Privacy</a></p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"ai-optimize-13\"><strong>Accessibility &amp; Seating</strong></p>\n<p class=\"ai-optimize-13\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.04em\">Our summer screens are located outside on the grass, so we recommend bringing a picnic blanket to sit on.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"paragraph\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif\">If you need to bring a chair due to specific mobility or injury reasons, please speak to one of our helpful stewards first, before setting up. They will help identify a suitable spot where you can put out your chair without blocking the view for other film goers.</span></p>\n<p>There is a dropped-curb in front of The entrance to the Ivy restaurant, for customers with wheelchairs to access the grass. Disabled customers take priority along this edge in front of the Ivy. Should you require assistance, a steward will be located in this area to provide additional support.</p>\n<p class=\"paragraph\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif\">All our films will be screened with subtitles to aid viewers with hearing impairments.</span></p>\n<p class=\"ai-optimize-14\">If you have any questions about accessibility to any of our events, please email <a href=\"mailto:arts+events@canarywharf.com\" role=\"link\">arts+events@canarywharf.com</a> for further information.</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Food &amp; Drink</strong></p>\n<p>You are welcome to bring their own food and drink; however, glass containers are not permitted. Please help us keep the space clean and tidy by taking all rubbish home with you or disposing of it in the bins provided.</p>\n<p class=\"ai-optimize-15\"></p></div></div><p></p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n                                </div>\n            </div>\n</div>\n  <!-- ENDS HIDE ACF FIELDS with WP Password Protect -->\n</div>\n<script>\n  dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];\n  dataLayer.push({\n    'event': 'eventdates',\n    'startdate': '2026-06-09',\n    'enddate': '2026-08-30'\n  });\n</script>\n<footer class=\"footer\">\n    <div class=\"footer__menu footer__menu--menus\">\n        <nav class=\"footer__menu-col\" aria-label=\"Information Menu\">\n            <button class=\"footer__accordion-button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"footer_me